      "body": "Closes #13464.\n\nTriage decision (task 21379, lane oc-code-08): do_request explicitly ALLOWS any frame-valid u16 port, with the reason recorded in code — no services_map membership check at the dial site.\n\nWhy not refuse (from do_request's actual consumers, per #6583 (a)):\n- The only in-tree frame-port producer is `fleet proxy connect --request … --service-port N` (client.rs:337-354, :461), deliberately typed Option<u16> with its own test pinning --service-port 8080 (non-table). A membership refusal would break that deliberate consumer.\n- The advertised table is host-local configurable discovery (hello/shims), not an ACL.\n- #6582 validate-where-read holds: type+range validated at the frame boundary (parse_port, #6516, already pinned); the dial stays token-gated.\n- Residual risk recorded in code: unadvertised port + arbitrary body is only as constrained as the service behind it (#6583 (b)).\n\nEnforcement: new dial_port() helper used by do_request + dial_port_passes_any_frame_valid_port_through test (absent→4799, table passthrough, 8080 and 65535 verbatim). Full fleet-proxy lib suite: 114 passed.\n\nEvidence: task 21379 · issue #13464 · coordinated with #6582 / #6583(a)(b).\n\n<!-- pm-metadata:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"direct_parent\": null,\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"design\": null,\n    \"roadmap_item\": null,\n    \"priority\": null\n  },\n  \"pm_meta\": 1,\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"queue_id\": null,\n    \"scheduled_start\": null,\n    \"picked_up_at\": null,\n    \"work_started_at\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-23T16:48:48Z\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ses_e5df6c39e70ffeI2YhyheGl4fx\",\n    \"lane\": null,\n    \"host\": \"amd\",\n    \"worktree\": \"/home/user/git/code-wt-oc08-13464\",\n    \"model\": null,\n    \"lane_start_issues\": [],\n    \"workspace_ref\": {\n      \"kind\": \"worktree\",\n      \"id\": \"/home/user/git/code-wt-oc08-13464\",\n      \"repo\": \"developing-today/code\",\n      \"branch\": \"felix/13464-proxy-port-membership\",\n      \"sha\": \"bcea651c9315f778afcefda620142750e5555146\"\n    },\n    \"auth_subject\": \"agent-next-23-local\",\n    \"stamped_by\": \"fleet 0.1.0 (native)\"\n  }\n}\n```\n<!-- pm-metadata:end -->\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1798044535&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=13475&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F13475&variant=proof_this_pr&signature=a0a01eed2c94903fbf168d06b80cb7e1f547cfd5588e989b6e7d120c18bcf9ca\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Proof this PR\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark-3x.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/13475?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
