      "body": "Part of #6583 (Phase 4 read-site inventory). Comment-only docs change:\n\n- `pkgs/fleet/crates/fleet-proxy/src/http.rs`: module doc now states the four-dimension read contract (type, range, arithmetic, count, #6582) validated at the read site, and the checked-arithmetic rule for chunk totals (#6512 dimension) — overflow via `checked_add` fails as `HttpError::Malformed` (http.rs:568-577).\n- `pkgs/fleet/crates/fleet-dispatch/src/lib.rs`: `read_response` reader comment points at the http.rs contract it follows (framing fixes from #8433, already on main).\n\nNo behavior change. Evidence inventory and per-site dispositions land on #6583.\n\nCloses #6583\n\n<!-- pm-metadata:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"direct_parent\": null,\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"design\": null,\n    \"roadmap_item\": null,\n    \"priority\": null\n  },\n  \"pm_meta\": 1,\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"queue_id\": null,\n    \"scheduled_start\": null,\n    \"picked_up_at\": null,\n    \"work_started_at\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-23T16:35:32Z\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ses_e5df6cae2e7ffeIJl8FJcbzlxP\",\n    \"lane\": null,\n    \"host\": \"amd\",\n    \"worktree\": \"/home/user/git/fleet/6583-phase4-docs-20261123T163414Z-94edd2ec\",\n    \"model\": null,\n    \"lane_start_issues\": [],\n    \"workspace_ref\": {\n      \"kind\": \"worktree\",\n      \"id\": \"/home/user/git/fleet/6583-phase4-docs-20261123T163414Z-94edd2ec\",\n      \"repo\": \"developing-today/code\",\n      \"branch\": \"work/6583-phase4-docs\",\n      \"sha\": \"f3e19dcf747b0ba8361cdf9d58d7e02704fa8094\"\n    },\n    \"auth_subject\": \"agent-next-23-local\",\n    \"stamped_by\": \"fleet 0.1.0 (native)\"\n  }\n}\n```\n<!-- pm-metadata:end -->\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1798043739&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=13460&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com